Pair the Shin’en pixel and vertex controls with their GPU blocks.
Validate SBPAK and embedded SDK 4 records before accepting their shader
code.

Upstream-Status: pending
Reason: Recover shader stages from early NVN containers used by FAST RMX and Giana Sisters.
Issue: unfiled (local FAST RMX and Giana Sisters macOS builds)

---
